Solve the problem step by step. At the end, write the final answer inside \boxed{}.

How many degrees are there in the measure of angle $P?$

[asy]
size (5cm,5cm);
pair A,B,C,D,E;

A=(0,1.1);
B=(4.5,0);
C=(6.4,1.7);
D=(4.2,5);
E=(0.5,4.2);

draw (A--B--C--D--E--A,linewidth(1));

label("$P$",A,SW);
label("$128^\circ$",shift(0,0.6)*B);

label("$92^\circ$",C,W);
